# Dolphin windows
## Game windows start titled exactly "Dolphin" → external monitor.
for_window [class="dolphin-emu" title="^Dolphin$"] move container to output DP-1-0
## NetPlay lobby → laptop screen, and make it tiled instead of floating.
for_window [class="dolphin-emu" title="^NetPlay$"] floating disable, move container to output eDP-1

# Clipboard management
